      "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:39:17.210Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone.</p>\n<p>We are new in the ERPNext, and would like your assistant. How can we fix that kind of messages/error in each of the modules: BUYING, SELLING, STOCK and CRM.</p>\n<p>Many thanks!</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/7/d7f8741a909be21425aafd24d626a19ba63e1ce8.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d7f8741a909be21425aafd24d626a19ba63e1ce8\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7f8741a909be21425aafd24d626a19ba63e1ce8_2_690x203.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"uOyXQVaailEO9CuNqVmUHVkyAHu\" width=\"690\" height=\"203\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7f8741a909be21425aafd24d626a19ba63e1ce8_2_690x203.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7f8741a909be21425aafd24d626a19ba63e1ce8_2_1035x304.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7f8741a909be21425aafd24d626a19ba63e1ce8_2_1380x406.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"7B7B7B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1456×430 23.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/4/4415ea4f6002059b377bee3b541e2317d2937ef6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/4415ea4f6002059b377bee3b541e2317d2937ef6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/4/4415ea4f6002059b377bee3b541e2317d2937ef6_2_690x196.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9Ijq7h9kYzf2cOLydirwF57bTdY\" width=\"690\" height=\"