    {
      "id": 486281,
      "username": "ITSV",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:03:16.741Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"saaad_asiiif\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"156731\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/saaad_asiiif/48/90603_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> saaad_asiiif:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>System Manager</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Thank you for your update. Could you please detail the necessary steps to modify the user?</p>\n<p>This is what we have in this moment: **<br>\n<a href=\"https://erp.esai.sv/app/user/it%40esai.sv\" title=\"IT - Admin\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">IT - Admin</a>** —&gt; Active —&gt; System User</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/6/c6f5097b47cc934481611275d9ad98dfe6fc6d4d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c6f5097b47cc934481611275d9ad98dfe6fc6d4d\" title=\"ERPNext-5\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c6f5097b47cc934481611275d9ad98dfe6fc6d4d_2_690x268.png\" alt=\"ERPNext-5\" data-base62-sha1=\"so3wLRt7aoKgvnTwV3FpGFb15b7\" width=\"690\" height=\"268\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c6f5097b47cc934481611275d9ad98dfe6fc6d4d_2_690x268.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c6f5097b47cc934481611275d9ad98dfe6fc6d4d_2_1035x402.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/6/c6f5097b47cc934481611275d9ad98dfe6fc6d4d.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">ERPNext-5</span><span class=\"informations\">1110×432 17.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/f/6f80fbf4065f31991ebb76db6f36a13595b0bb8e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/6f80fbf4065f31991ebb76db6f36a13595b0bb8e\" title=\"ERPNext-6\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/f/6f80fbf4065f31991ebb76db6f36a13595b0bb8e_2_690x203.png\" alt=\"ERPNext-6\" data-base62-sha1=\"fUpluf4wgZGxO0O8gP2dMpSKOXI\" width=\"690\" height=\"203\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/f/6f80fbf4065f31991ebb76db6f36a13595b0bb8e_2_690x203.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/f/6f80fbf4065f31991ebb76db6f36a13595b0bb8e_2_1035x304.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/f/6f80fbf4065f31991ebb76db6f36a13595b0bb8e_2_1380x406.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">ERPNext-6</span><span class=\"informations\">1414×417 23.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
