      "id": 486325,
      "username": "ITSV",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-11-13T05:15:22.565Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"saaad_asiiif\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"156731\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/saaad_asiiif/48/90603_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> saaad_asiiif:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>System Manager</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Dear Saaad,</p>\n<p>Thank you for your help. I found it somewhat difficult to follow the steps you provided. I may need some time to get familiar with the application.</p>\n<p>Currently, I selected all (see the screenshot), saved, and logged in again. As a result, the messages disappeared from each of the modules I mentioned earlier. So, they no longer show the messages. Is this the correct process, or should I follow the steps you provided?</p>\n<p>I also have another question:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>I attached some new screenshots, but it seems that the width of my ERP window is cut off. What could be the reason for this and how to fix it?</li>\n<li>I attempted to change from System User to System Manager but struggled to follow the steps. Perhaps my ERPNext needs further configuration, or the version might be outdated? Is there a video available that I can follow easily to change to System Manager?</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Thank you for your assistance!</p>\n<p>Best regards,</p>\n<p>IT</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/1/91fb0accd97044f0ee138fd7f738e2a8e1e0c687.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/91fb0accd97044f0ee138fd7f738e2a8e1e0c687\" title=\"ERPNext-7\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/1/91fb0accd97044f0ee138fd7f738e2a8e1e0c687_2_690x410.png\" alt=\"ERPNext-7\" data-base62-sha1=\"kPp5uFjuFrUISYwiNZdXnKJc0rd\" width=\"690\" height=\"410\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/1/91fb0accd97044f0ee138fd7f738e2a8e1e0c687_2_690x410.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/1/91fb0accd97044f0ee138fd7f738e2a8e1e0c687_2_1035x615.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/1/91fb0accd97044f0ee138fd7f738e2a8e1e0c687.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F5F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">ERPNext-7</span><span class=\"informations\">1082×643 53.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/2/0281b217525c0c9057effccdd8cb2d3c0793398a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0281b217525c0c9057effccdd8cb2d3c0793398a\" title=\"ERPNext-9\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/0281b217525c0c9057effccdd8cb2d3c0793398a_2_690x365.png\" alt=\"ERPNext-9\" data-base62-sha1=\"maPfyNmlhOlMC2PMHhgmEm547g\" width=\"690\" height=\"365\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/0281b217525c0c9057effccdd8cb2d3c0793398a_2_690x365.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/0281b217525c0c9057effccdd8cb2d3c0793398a_2_1035x547.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/0281b217525c0c9057effccdd8cb2d3c0793398a_2_1380x730.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">ERPNext-9</span><span class=\"informations\">1570×831 71.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
